    "description": "<p>Unless defined by other Charms, the Ebon Dragon's Yozi body can take any shape he desires with a size ranging from 1-100 yards in any dimension. In any shape, he is made of tangible darkness and possesses the same traits. Natural soak is (Willpower + Essence)B/L/A. He naturally heals one bashing or lethal level per hour or one aggravated per day. He is completely immune to all harm or penalties from environmental conditions not imposed by direct actions of another being, and to all harm not imposed with a Charm, spell, artifact or other magical effect. His base movement rate is 15 yards per tick (30 yards dashing) with any form of locomotion, including flight and teleportation through barriers.</p>",
